# x86 Smoke Coverage Matrix — per-module static audit

File: openOODA/audit/x86-smoke-coverage.oot
Status: smoke — read-only static source audit, no compiler run, no fixture rewrite
Scope: 42 x86_*.oo modules in ooda/oodac/ against 107 x86 smoke candidates in ooda/scripts/, 2026-08-25

---

